      "writtenOn": "2025-09-12T09:06:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for all the pointers and explanations! With the latest patchset, I don\u0027t stumble upon this issue anymore. One thing worth noting is that the [proposal](https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/blob/main/proposals/texture-component-swizzle.md#validation) has the following validation already:\n```\nIf descriptor.usage includes the RENDER_ATTACHMENT or STORAGE_BINDING bit:\n- descriptor.swizzle.r must be \"r\".\n- descriptor.swizzle.g must be \"g\".\n- descriptor.swizzle.b must be \"b\".\n- descriptor.swizzle.a must be \"a\".\n```",
      "parentUuid": "7352e95a_e91571c2",
      "revId": "17896857fef0d1f70b34f97f1ee34c67926fcd78",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
